 <body>
  <title><p>Harbour Notes</p></title>
  <epigraph><p>A short book of quay-side notes.</p></epigraph>
  <section>
   <title><p>The Ferry</p></title>
   <p>The ferry leaves at seven. Café tables fill early, and the señor at the counter pours coffee without asking.<a l:href="#n1" type="note">[1]</a></p>
   <subtitle>A quiet stretch</subtitle>
   <p>Gulls argue over crusts; everyone says “good morning” in three languages.</p>
   <empty-line/>
   <image l:href="#pixel.png"/>
   <section><title><p>Timetable</p></title><p>Ferry 07:00, launch 09:30 — prices are posted by the quay.</p></section>
  </section>
  <section>
   <title><p>Afterword</p></title>
   <poem><stanza><v>Salt on the rail</v><v>Rope coiled on the stones</v></stanza></poem>
  </section>
 </body>
 <body name="notes">
  <section id="n1"><title><p>1</p></title><p>Posted prices change with the season.</p></section>
